# Markdown Formatter ignore patterns
# Paths are relative to the Obsidian vault/workspace root.
# * matches within one path segment, ** crosses directories, and ? matches one character.
# Prefix a pattern with ! to re-include a path matched by an earlier pattern.

# Ignore all templates
Templates/**

# Ignore generated notes anywhere in the vault
*.generated.md

# Ignore Markdown under Archive, including nested folders
Archive/**/*.md

# Re-include one generated note
!important.generated.md
